		(descr "Arduino UNO MIDI shield (board marking K194725ASJH) as a stacked module: the older 6+6 / 8+8 header pattern (28 pins, numbered as in the stock Arduino_UNO_R3 footprint, no NC/IOREF/SDA/SCL), true top view (R3 power pin 1 position at the origin, digital header toward -Y, USB end toward -X), board 57.2 x 53 mm. Three DIN-5 sockets drawn on F.Fab. Pads are the shield pins; the host needs female headers. Layout from photos and calipers, see projects/midi-shield.")
